<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Application for enrolling in ECH 4944: Industry Internship</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", "DejaVu Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #000;
  }

  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }

  /* Page 1 styles */
  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .logo-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .logo-box {
    background-color: #1a5c38;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
    margin-right: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .logo-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .logo-text .univ-name {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a5c38;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .logo-text .college-name {
    font-size: 8px;
    color: #1a5c38;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .header-address {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #000;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #2e5fa3;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .title-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 2px solid #000;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .instruction-text {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .form-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  .form-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .form-table td.label-cell {
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 220px;
    background-color: #fff;
  }

  .form-table td.value-cell {
    width: auto;
    min-height: 28px;
  }

  .form-table tr.tall-row td {
    height: 50px;
  }

  .form-table tr.medium-row td {
    height: 40px;
  }

  .form-table tr.spacer-row td {
    height: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #000;
  }

  /* Page 2 styles */
  .duties-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .duties-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .duties-table td.label-cell {
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 220px;
  }

  .duties-table td.value-cell {
    height: 200px;
  }

  .agreement-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .agreement-bold {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Page 3 styles */
  .report-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2e5fa3;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .report-intro {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2e5fa3;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .report-format-intro {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .report-format-list {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .report-format-list li {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .report-format-list ol {
    padding-left: 20px;
    list-style-type: lower-alpha;
  }

  .slides-list {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .slides-list li {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- PAGE 1 -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <div class="logo-box">USF</div>
      <div class="logo-text">
        <span class="univ-name">UNIVERSITY OF<br>SOUTH FLORIDA</span>
        <span class="college-name">College of Engineering</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-address">
      <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="college_name">{{ college_name }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="address_line1">{{ address_line1 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="address_line2">{{ address_line2 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="phone_fax_line">{{ phone_fax_line }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-title">Application for enrolling in <span data-field="course_code">{{ course_code }}</span>:<br>
  <span data-field="course_title">{{ course_title }}</span></div>
  <hr class="title-divider">

  <p class="instruction-text">Please complete this and email to <span data-field="coordinator_name">{{ coordinator_name }}</span> with letter from company offering you the industry internship experience.</p>

  <table class="form-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Your name ( Last, First)</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Student U number</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="student_u_number">{{ student_u_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Today's Date</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="todays_date">{{ todays_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="tall-row">
      <td class="label-cell">Your address ( street, city,<br>state, zip code)</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="student_address">{{ student_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Email address</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="student_email">{{ student_email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Phone number</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="student_phone">{{ student_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="spacer-row">
      <td class="label-cell" style="border:1px solid #000;"></td>
      <td class="value-cell" style="border:1px solid #000;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Name of company</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="tall-row">
      <td class="label-cell">Address of company</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="company_address">{{ company_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Hours of work per week</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="hours_per_week">{{ hours_per_week }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Starting and ending date</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="start_end_date">{{ start_end_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Total hours expected at internship</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="total_hours">{{ total_hours }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Total credits you would like to register for</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="total_credits">{{ total_credits }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Name of Supervisor</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="supervisor_name">{{ supervisor_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Email of supervisor</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="supervisor_email">{{ supervisor_email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Phone no of supervisor</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="supervisor_phone">{{ supervisor_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<!-- PAGE 2 -->
<div class="page">
  <table class="duties-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="label-cell">Expected duties and responsibilities</td>
      <td class="value-cell"><span data-field="expected_duties">{{ expected_duties }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p class="agreement-text">I understand the implications of signing up for this course. I agree to provide a written report and PowerPoint presentation before the semester ends. The course will be graded as S/U. If completed successfully, it will count as a technical elective towards the degree in chemical engineering.</p>

  <p class="agreement-text">Your supervisor will be contacted after you submit your report to confirm that you have successfully completed this industry internship.</p>

  <p class="agreement-bold">By submitting this application by email, I agree that I have read the requirements of the course and agree to meet those requirements.</p>
</div>

<!-- PAGE 3 -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="report-title"><span data-field="report_requirements_title">{{ report_requirements_title }}</span></div>

  <p class="report-intro">A formal technical report is required at the end of the semester before the grading period ends. It must be submitted electronically on Canvas. In addition a PowerPoint slide presentation must also be submitted.</p>

  <div class="section-heading">Report Format</div>

  <p class="report-format-intro">The suggested format for the report is as follows:</p>
  <ol class="report-format-list">
    {% for item in report_format_items %}
    <li>
      <span data-field="report_format_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].text">{{ item.text }}</span>
      {% if item.sub_items %}
      <ol>
        {% for sub in item.sub_items %}
        <li><span data-field="report_format_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].sub_items[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ sub }}</span></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>

  <div class="section-heading">PowerPoint Slides</div>

  <ul class="slides-list">
    {% for slide in powerpoint_slides %}
    <li><span data-field="powerpoint_slides[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ slide }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>

</body>
</html>